 "name_en": "Shareholding Management (5WF)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Shareholding Management (5WF)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio71490c3e67774a77973f8b6909439e4f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio71490c3e67774a77973f8b6909439e4f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The scope item helps you to better manage your shareholding instruments. You can automate labor-intensive processes, such as payment handling and accounting postings, giving you more time to focus on value-added activities. You can manage operational and accounting requirements.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The current scope covers the processes to create securities accounts and security classes, and to purchase, book keep, recognize dividends, and sell a shareholding transaction.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio71490c3e67774a77973f8b6909439e4f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create security account and class</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create shareholding purchase transaction</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Set settlement status</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Maintain and post cash dividend</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create and post corporate action</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform period-end closing</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create shareholding sale transaction</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform reporting</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio71490c3e67774a77973f8b6909439e4f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Review the status for shareholding instruments easily</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Support the management of shareholding, including creation of security class and security accounts, and the transactions, payments, recognition of dividend, and so on</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Make better operational and strategic decisions using the comprehensive reporting and analysis tools</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Improve internal operational compliance</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>股权管理 (5WF)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio71490c3e67774a77973f8b6909439e4f\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio71490c3e67774a77973f8b6909439e4f__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">该范围项目可帮助您更好地管理股权工具。您可以自动化劳动密集型流程（例如付款处理和会计过账），从而有更多时间专注于增值活动。您可以管理运营和会计要求。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">当前范围涵盖创建证券账户和证券类、采购、记账、确认股息和销售股权交易的流程。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio71490c3e67774a77973f8b6909439e4f__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建证券账户和类</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建股权采购交易</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">设置结算状态</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">维护和过账现金股息</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建并过账法人行为</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行期末关账</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">创建股权销售交易</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行报表</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio71490c3e67774a77973f8b6909439e4f__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">轻松检查股权工具的状态</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">支持股权管理，包括创建证券类和证券账户、交易、付款、确认股息等</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">使用全面的报表和分析工具，制定更明智的运营和战略决策</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提高内部运营合规性</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
